Just a side note: If you're going to take off most of your armor, it's
best to do it in a small-ish locked/barricaded room on a no-teleport
level.  e.g. using a boulder on the first level of Sokoban to block
the staircase area off from most of the level gives you a relatively
safe zone.  The corner rooms in the Castle are also nice (especially
the one with Elbereth already engraved for you).



